    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detachment Crew is a sci-fi dungeon crawling game where you control a party of handcrafted characters, trying to restore a recently disabled mining facility.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/extras/26dda76e2886b4358156da1e0c504804.poster.avif?t=1750146723\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/extras/26dda76e2886b4358156da1e0c504804.webm?t=1750146723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully select your crew, as every character has unique skills for combat and for deeper exploration of the industrial hellscape surrounding the mining tower. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/extras/0ec48b472feca85d811970b8ff0540fc.avif?t=1750146723\" data-has-big width=800 height=307 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather enough food to feed your crew every day. Some of the crew members can be very picky eaters, so be careful.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/extras/d9dd38c55951e0ffe3291fddea00cc04.avif?t=1750146723\" data-has-big width=800 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various biomes, from lush forests and wild mountains to deep mines of the Concern Operation.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detachment Crew is a sci-fi dungeon crawling game where you control a party of handcrafted characters, trying to restore a recently disabled mining facility.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/extras/26dda76e2886b4358156da1e0c504804.poster.avif?t=1750146723\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/extras/26dda76e2886b4358156da1e0c504804.webm?t=1750146723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully select your crew, as every character has unique skills for combat and for deeper exploration of the industrial hellscape surrounding the mining tower. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/extras/0ec48b472feca85d811970b8ff0540fc.avif?t=1750146723\" data-has-big width=800 height=307 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather enough food to feed your crew every day. Some of the crew members can be very picky eaters, so be careful.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/extras/d9dd38c55951e0ffe3291fddea00cc04.avif?t=1750146723\" data-has-big width=800 height=354 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various biomes, from lush forests and wild mountains to deep mines of the Concern Operation.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A sci-fi dungeon crawling game with handmade visuals, real time combat and unique exploration options. Build your path through the wilderness, meet the crew, don\u2019t let anyone starve.",
